From 1a10548156b0b94b487bf80c0922a368ad77781d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Producdevity <y.gherbi.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:52:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add an AURORA_RENDERER=starlet path without Dawn

With AURORA_STARLET_DIR set, AURORA_RENDERER=starlet makes Aurora create
its SDL3 window with SDL_WINDOW_OPENGL and OpenGL ES 3.1 attributes,
skip Dawn/WebGPU, gfx::initialize and the render worker, and drain the
GX FIFO on the calling thread into Starlet's bridge, which draws with
OpenGL ES and swaps the window. Without the variable Aurora behaves as
before. Without AURORA_STARLET_DIR the hooks compile to inert stubs.

Hooks for Starlet: texture data snapshots, display list sources, the
GXSetCopyFilter registers and the 342 viewport origin, each active only
under Starlet. RmlUi and ImGui are not available under Starlet.
---
